  "distractor_rules": {
    "roots": [
      "Offer four verb forms and keep exactly one that agrees with the stem pronoun.",
      "Leave the verb out of the stem. Do not mark the gap with a blank line or underscore.",
      "Never include a second form that also makes a true sentence, such as a past form when no time word blocks it.",
      "Use now or yesterday when is and was, or are and were, would both fit.",
      "Wrong choices stay close: wrong person, wrong number, or -ing. Do not use random nouns.",
      "Keep stems in kid world: home, school, food, pets, play, family, or weather.",
      "Use <NAME> or <NAME> and <NAME2> for people. Never write a real name."
    ]
  },
