  "tier_rules": {
    "1": "Short stems of four or five words. Use am, is, are, have, and has. Wrong choices are other person forms of be or have. Add a noun picture.",
    "2": "Grade-level stems of five to seven words. Use present action verbs. He, she, and it take the -s form. I, you, we, and they take the plain form.",
    "3": "Near misses. Lock tense with now or yesterday. Use they was, you is, and a name plus I with is as traps."
  },
